        "label": "Launch — Proton-K / Blok D",
        "description": "Baikonur Cosmodrome, 1970-09-12. Luna 16 — first robotic lunar sample return. Launched 14 months after Apollo 11's crewed sample return demonstrated that the Soviet Luna program was a viable lower-risk alternative path."
